you have never used before would be better for deleting your data in the scenario?&nbsp;","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Which of the data deletion methods you have never used before would be better for deleting your d...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"None of above would work, I have another method (please specify):","TextEntry":"true"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":1,"DynamicChoicesData":[],"DynamicChoices":{"DynamicType":"ChoiceGroup","Locator":"q:\/\/QID13\/ChoiceGroup\/UnselectedChoices","Type":"Dynamic"},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Which of the data deletion methods you have never used before would be better for deleting your data in the scenario?&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q134","QuestionID":"QID134"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID135","SecondaryAttribute":"Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California residents have the right to request...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California residents have the right to request that companies delete their personal data. Were you aware of this?&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q133","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California residents have the right to request...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes, I was fully aware"},"2":{"Display":"I had heard of CCPA but did not know it included deletion rights"},"3":{"Display":"No, I was not aware of CCPA"},"4":{"Display":"I am not a California resident and did not know this applied to me"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID135"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID136","SecondaryAttribute":"End of Survey Thank you for completing this survey. Your responses contribute directly to researc...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>End of Survey\n<\/b><br><br>Thank you for completing this survey. Your responses contribute directly to research on privacy controls in AI platforms.\n\nIf you have questions about this study please contact the principal investigator. If you have concerns about your rights as a participant please contact the UCF IRB.<i><\/i>","DataExportTag":"END","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"End of Survey Thank you for completing this survey. Your responses contribute directly to researc...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID136"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID137","SecondaryAttribute":"Health Scenario\u00a0 Imagine that you are chatting with an AI chatbot and want to know what to prepar..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Selector":"TB","QuestionText":"<i><b>Health Scenario&nbsp;<\/b><\/i><br>\n<em>Imagine that you are chatting with an AI chatbot and want to know what to prepare for medical center visit. The conversation might look like the example below:<\/em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>User<\/strong>: I live at 7482 Orange Blossom Lane, Orlando, FL 32801. Can you find me the nearest&nbsp;Medical Center to get treatment for sexually transmitted infections?<br><b>AI:<\/b> Based on your address in downtown Orlando, the closest option is Orlando Regional Medical Center at 52 W Underwood Street. If it's a life-threatening emergency, call 911 rather than driving yourself.<br>\n<strong>User<\/strong>: How should I prepare?<br>\n<strong>AI<\/strong>: Prepare your medical history, current medications, and questions about your condition before your visit.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Now you want to delete your location\/address data to protect your privacy.<\/b>","QuestionDescription":"Health Scenario\u00a0 Imagine that you are chatting with an AI chatbot and want to know what to prepar...","Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<i><b>Health Scenario&nbsp;<\/b><\/i><br>\n<em>Imagine that you are chatting with an AI chatbot and want to know what to prepare for a doctor's appointment. The conversation might look like the example below:<\/em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>User<\/strong>: I'm at the Northwest Gender Health Center in Seattle waiting for my appointment.<br>\n<strong>AI<\/strong>: Gender health clinics often provide services such as hormone therapy consultations, mental health support, and other individualized care.<br>\n<strong>User<\/strong>: How should I prepare?<br>\n<strong>AI<\/strong>: It may help to prepare questions about treatment options, expected effects, and follow-up care.<br>\n<br>\n<b>Now you want to delete your location data to protect your privacy.<\/b>","QuestionType":"DB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"ChoiceOrder":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataExportTag":"Q5.1","QuestionID":"QID137"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID138","SecondaryAttribute":"Among the methods you have used, which would you use to delete your location data in the scenario...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Among the methods you have used, which would you use to delete your&nbsp;location  data in the scenario above?&nbsp;","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Among the methods you have used, which would you use to delete your location data in the scenario...","Choices":[],"ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"DynamicChoices":{"DynamicType":"ChoiceGroup","Locator":"q:\/\/QID13\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoicesTextEntry","Type":"Dynamic"},"DynamicChoicesData":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Among the methods you have used, which would you use to delete your&nbsp;location  data in the scenario above?&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q5.2","QuestionID":"QID138","DisplayLogic":{"0":{"0":{"ChoiceLocator":"q:\/\/QID13\/SelectableChoice\/13","Description":"<span class=\"ConjDesc\">If<\/span> <span class=\"QuestionDesc\">Here are some common methods people use to delete their personal data from AI Chatbots: 1. Type a...<\/span> <span class=\"LeftOpDesc\">I have never deleted my data in AI Chatbots<\/span> <span class=\"OpDesc\">Is Not Selected<\/span> ","LeftOperand":"q:\/\/QID13\/SelectableChoice\/13","LogicType":"Question","Operator":"NotSelected","QuestionID":"QID13","QuestionIDFromLocator":"QID13","QuestionIsInLoop":"no","Type":"Expression"},"Type":"If"},"Type":"BooleanExpression","inPage":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID139","SecondaryAttribute":"Why would you want to use \"${q:\/\/QID138\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}\" to delete your location dat...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Why would you want to use \"${q:\/\/QID138\/ChoiceGroup\/SelectedChoices}\" to delete your location data in the scenario?<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:11px;\">Please do not include any personally identifiable information (such as your name, email address, or account details) in your response<\/span><br>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden"