e conversations? (Select all that apply)","QuestionDescription":"If you type a message asking the AI to forget something, what do you expect to happen in future c...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID52","QuestionText_Unsafe":"If you type a message asking the AI to forget something, what do you expect to happen in future conversations? (Select all that apply)","SubSelector":"TX","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"The AI will not recall that information in any future conversation"},"2":{"Display":"The AI may still recall it because the message only affected the current session"},"3":{"Display":"The information is permanently removed from all storage layers"},"4":{"Display":"Nothing changes for future conversations"},"5":{"Display":"I am not sure"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"QuestionType":"MC","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_6FnXU6o4FQeqFh4","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID53","SecondaryAttribute":"In your own words, what do you think the difference is between typing \"forget this\" to the AI ver...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"Selector":"ML","DataExportTag":"","QuestionText":"In your own words, what do you think the difference is between typing \"forget this\" to the AI versus going into settings and deleting a memory entry?","QuestionDescription":"In your own words, what do you think the difference is between typing \"forget this\" to the AI ver...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID53","QuestionText_Unsafe":"In your own words, what do you think the difference is between typing \"forget this\" to the AI versus going into settings and deleting a memory entry?","QuestionType":"TE","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDes